# adlaplace

Laplace approximations for hierarchical models using CppAD and trust-region optimization.

## Package layout

| Layer | R | C++ |
|-------|---|-----|
| Model (formula, S4 terms) | `effects.R`, `model_setup.R`, term `*.R` | — |
| Laplace (AD handle, profile likelihood) | `get_ad_fun.R`, `logLikLaplace.R`, `wrappers.R` | `get_ad_fun_raw`, `inner_opt`, … |
| Engine (eval, optimizer) | `R/RcppExports.R` | `src/*.cpp`, `src/include/adlaplace/` |

Public headers for backend packages live in `inst/include/adlaplace/` (including `math/lgamma.hpp` for custom likelihoods). Private engine headers are in `src/include/adlaplace/`.

See `inst/doc/extending-adlaplace.Rmd` for writing a backend package.
